stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> idle: ensure_nudge
    idle --> nudging: tick arms the card
    nudging --> awaiting: nudge fired
    awaiting --> nudging: reply, or advance_chunk
    nudging --> resolved: last step done, or archive_card
    nudging --> consequences: record_consequences
    consequences --> idle: reschedule_after_consequences
    note right of consequences
        resolved and consequences are also reachable from awaiting.
        The 4:30 reconcile sends any live stage to nudging
        if scheduled today, else to idle.
    end note
